{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgowfNpmqCke1wpWvCxcr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's how I'd tell it to my son on the phone.\n\n**What I decided:** Nothing yet. I'll ask you first, or the bank. Out of all of it, only a few names sounded safe to me: \"גמל כספי (שקלי)\" and \"גמל אג\"ח ממשלות\". They show about 4.4% to 4.9% for 3 years and about 2.2% to 3.7% for 5 years. The fee on them is about half a percent, from 0.45% at הראל and כלל to 0.65% at מור. I'm not sure what I'd be getting, because I don't know how that compares with my deposits.\n\nThere was one line I wanted to understand: \"בר קרן גמולים א' – מבטיח תשואה בשיעור 5.5 אחוז לשנה\" at כלל, with a fee of 0.2%. A promised 5.5% a year sounds like a deposit that pays more. But its returns say \"לא דווח\" (not reported), and the other fee says \"עוד לא דווח\". So I don't really know what it is.\n\n**What I looked at:**\n- **Top:** the heading \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\" and the 182 tracks from 15 companies. There was an orange note, \"נתוני הרשות לא עודכנו מאז ספטמבר 2026\".\n- **Below that:** a big table split by company: מיטב, מור, הפניקס, אלטשולר שחם, כלל, הראל, and the beginning of אנליסט. I read the track names, the fee \"מהחיסכון\", and the 3- and 5-year returns.\n- **Where I stopped:** after five screens. It's a black screen packed with numbers and I was tired. I didn't get to screens 6 to 10.\n\n**What I skipped:**\n- The row of buttons with English like \"s&p 500\" and the word \"עוקב מדד\".\n- The little coloured circles and the green and yellow dots.\n- The numbers with arrows next to each track.\n- \"123 מקור / מחושב / הזנה\" near the top.\n\n**Words and signs I didn't understand:**\n- S&P500 and \"עוקב מדדים\". To me מדד is the price index on the news.\n- \"מט\"ח\" with a percentage, and \"ההפקדה\" next to \"ההחיסכון\".\n- Percentages over 100: \"101%\" stocks, \"103%\" foreign currency.\n- \"פחות מ־3 שנים\", \"חדש\", \"הלכה\".\n- \"לפני דמי ניהול\": so what do I actually get?\n- The writing is light grey on black, and the small lines were hard to read.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- The track \"גמל אג\"ח סחיר\" says 92% foreign currency. I thought bonds were something local and safe.\n- The tracks that promise a return show \"לא דווח\" exactly where I wanted numbers.\n- My own bank isn't there at all.\n- The big numbers like 28% stuck in my head and frightened me, not tempted me."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3938,"cache_read_input_tokens":18548,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3938},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c500e896-a2e0-4d7f-9030-9c2d6e0dfc12","uuid":"06247045-7cce-477e-84db-daa112b522ac","timestamp":"2026-11-07T17:14:19.284Z","request_id":"req_011CgowfNB5kxndabYoV9gq5"}
